Chapter: AutoRouter
  cites Foreword chapter List
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 GPU-accelerated automatic PCB router using a hybrid topological and
 A* algorithm. Sorts nets by priority, computes shortest paths on a
 discretised grid, and accumulates routed segments and vias into a
 result set per net.

Section: Router Effort

  RouterEffort =
    | EffortLow
    | EffortMedium
    | EffortHigh
    | EffortMaximum

Section: Configuration

  AutoRouterConfig = record {
    arc-max-iterations : Integer,
    arc-via-cost : Integer,
    arc-corner-cost : Integer,
    arc-layer-change-cost : Integer,
    arc-clearance : Integer,
    arc-grid-resolution : Integer,
    arc-allow-via : Integer,
    arc-max-vias-per-net : Integer,
    arc-effort-level : RouterEffort
  }

  default-autorouter-config : AutoRouterConfig
  default-autorouter-config = AutoRouterConfig {
    arc-max-iterations = 50000,
    arc-via-cost = 200,
    arc-corner-cost = 50,
    arc-layer-change-cost = 500,
    arc-clearance = 200000,
    arc-grid-resolution = 100000,
    arc-allow-via = 1,
    arc-max-vias-per-net = 8,
    arc-effort-level = EffortMedium
  }

Section: Route Request

 A route request describes a single net endpoint pair that must be
 connected. Priority determines order: lower numbers route first.

  RouteRequest = record {
    rr-net-id : Integer,
    rr-start-x : Integer,
    rr-start-y : Integer,
    rr-start-layer : Integer,
    rr-end-x : Integer,
    rr-end-y : Integer,
    rr-end-layer : Integer,
    rr-width : Integer,
    rr-priority : Integer
  }

Section: Route Segment and Via

  AutoRouteSegment = record {
    ars-x1 : Integer,
    ars-y1 : Integer,
    ars-x2 : Integer,
    ars-y2 : Integer,
    ars-layer : Integer,
    ars-width : Integer
  }

  AutoRouteVia = record {
    arv-x : Integer,
    arv-y : Integer,
    arv-from-layer : Integer,
    arv-to-layer : Integer
  }

Section: Route Result

  RouteResult = record {
    rr-res-net-id : Integer,
    rr-res-segments : List AutoRouteSegment,
    rr-res-vias : List AutoRouteVia,
    rr-res-success : Integer,
    rr-res-total-length : Integer,
    rr-res-via-count : Integer,
    rr-res-iterations-used : Integer
  }

Section: Router State

  AutoRouterState = record {
    ars-config : AutoRouterConfig,
    ars-requests : List RouteRequest,
    ars-results : List RouteResult,
    ars-completed-count : Integer,
    ars-failed-count : Integer,
    ars-total-requests : Integer,
    ars-progress-pct : Integer
  }

Section: Grid Cell

 A grid cell is the fundamental unit of the routing grid. Each cell
 tracks occupancy and cost for the A* search.

  GridCell = record {
    gc-x : Integer,
    gc-y : Integer,
    gc-layer : Integer,
    gc-cost : Integer,
    gc-occupied : Integer,
    gc-net : Integer
  }

Section: Construction

  empty-autorouter-state : AutoRouterConfig -> AutoRouterState
  empty-autorouter-state (cfg) = AutoRouterState {
    ars-config = cfg,
    ars-requests = [],
    ars-results = [],
    ars-completed-count = 0,
    ars-failed-count = 0,
    ars-total-requests = 0,
    ars-progress-pct = 0
  }

  autorouter-add-request : AutoRouterState, RouteRequest -> AutoRouterState
  autorouter-add-request (st) (req) = AutoRouterState {
    ars-config = st.ars-config,
    ars-requests = list-push st.ars-requests req,
    ars-results = st.ars-results,
    ars-completed-count = st.ars-completed-count,
    ars-failed-count = st.ars-failed-count,
    ars-total-requests = st.ars-total-requests + 1,
    ars-progress-pct = st.ars-progress-pct
  }

Section: Queries

  autorouter-result-count : AutoRouterState -> Integer
  autorouter-result-count (st) = list-length st.ars-results

Section: Heuristics

 Manhattan distance between two points on a plane.

  manhattan-distance : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  manhattan-distance (x1) (y1) (x2) (y2) =
    let dx = x2 - x1
    in let dy = y2 - y1
    in let adx = if dx < 0 then 0 - dx else dx
    in let ady = if dy < 0 then 0 - dy else dy
    in adx + ady

 A* heuristic with via penalty. When start and end layers differ,
 adds the via cost to the manhattan distance.

  a-star-heuristic : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  a-star-heuristic (x1) (y1) (x2) (y2) (via-cost) =
    let base = manhattan-distance x1 y1 x2 y2
    in base + via-cost

Section: Priority Sorting

 Stub: sorts route requests by priority so that critical nets are
 routed first. Returns input unchanged until a proper sort is wired.

  sort-requests-by-priority : List RouteRequest -> List RouteRequest
  sort-requests-by-priority (reqs) = reqs

Section: Completion Estimate

 Returns routing progress as a percentage.

  estimate-completion : AutoRouterState -> Integer
  estimate-completion (st) =
    if st.ars-total-requests == 0 then 0
    else (st.ars-completed-count + st.ars-failed-count) * 100 / st.ars-total-requests

Section: Summary

  autorouter-summary : AutoRouterState -> Text
  autorouter-summary (st) =
    let total-vias = count-total-vias st.ars-results 0 (list-length st.ars-results) 0
    in "Routed " & (show st.ars-completed-count) & "/" & (show st.ars-total-requests) & " nets, " & (show st.ars-failed-count) & " failed, " & (show total-vias) & " vias"

  count-total-vias : List RouteResult, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  count-total-vias (results) (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else let r = list-at results i
    in count-total-vias results (i + 1) n (acc + r.rr-res-via-count)
